    <preQTxt>The next 6 questions ask about drinking alcohol. This includes drinking COUNTRY SPECIFIC EXAMPLES. Drinking alcohol does not include drinking a few sips of wine for religious purposes. A "drink" is a glass of wine, a bottle of beer, a small glass of liquor, or a mixed drink. 

Staggering when walking, not being able to speak right, and throwing up are some signs of being really drunk.</preQTxt>
    <qstnLit>During your life, how many times did you drink so much alcohol that you were really drunk?</qstnLit>
  </qstn>
