  <labl>Seriously injured</labl>
  <qstn>
    <preQTxt>The next 3 questions ask about serious injuries that happened to you. An injury is serious when it makes you miss at least one full day of usual activities (such as school, sports, or a job) or requires treatment by a doctor or nurse.</preQTxt>
